            ],
            "body": "<div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field-item\"><div class=\"full\" style=\"gap:2em;\"><div class=\"item\"><img src=\"/files/undraw_innovative_re_rr5i.svg\" alt=\"work image\"></div><div class=\"item\"><h3>Understanding Xenophobia</h3><p>DeMoLiSH unravels the roots of hate, fostering understanding through advanced research methods.</p><h3>Empowering Change</h3><p>Short-term impact: Advancing interdisciplinary research and providing tools to reshape the narrative.</p><h3>Building a Tolerant Future</h3><p>Long-term goals: Influencing the core of xenophobia, addressing hate speech, and supporting victims—DeMoLiSH for a more tolerant world.</p><p><a class=\"button-link\" href=\"/project/demolish-in-brief\">Read more</a></p></div></div></div>"
        },
